{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：「那時，猶大王、首領、祭司、先知及耶路撒冷居民的骸骨都要從墳墓中被取出來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拋散在他們昔日戀慕、供奉、追隨、求問、祭拜的日月星辰之下，無人收殮和埋葬，他們好像地上的糞便。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我要把這邪惡民族的餘民流放到各地，他們在那裡必痛不欲生。這是萬軍之耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華吩咐我對猶大人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「人跌倒後難道不站起來嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人走錯了路難道不回頭嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼耶路撒冷的居民一味地背叛我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們詭詐成性，不肯回頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仔細聽，沒有人說實話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人為自己的惡行後悔，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我做了可怕的事！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人一意孤行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像戰馬直奔戰場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天空的鸛鳥尚且知道來去的季節，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斑鳩、燕子和白鶴也遵守遷徙的時間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的子民卻不知道耶和華的法則。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「你們怎能說，『我們有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們有耶和華的律法』？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誠然，律法教師撒謊的筆把律法篡改了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智者必蒙羞辱，受驚嚇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被捉拿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他們既棄掉耶和華的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪裡還有智慧可言呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要把他們的妻子交給別人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們的田地交給新主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們無論尊卑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"個個貪圖不義之財；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無論是先知還是祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都行為詭詐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們敷衍了事地醫治我子民的傷痛，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『沒事了，沒事了！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實情況很糟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們做可憎的事會羞愧嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不！他們不知廉恥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不臉紅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們要與滅亡的人一同滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要在我懲罰之時覆滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要徹底滅絕他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄樹不結葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無花果樹不結果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹葉也要枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所賜給他們的都要被奪走。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他們說：「我們為什麼還坐在這裡？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大家一起進入堅城，死在那裡吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的上帝耶和華要毀滅我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給我們毒水喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們得罪了祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們期待平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻沒有祥和；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到醫治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻飽受驚嚇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"「從但傳來敵人戰馬的鼻息聲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的駿馬嘶鳴，震動大地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要來吞滅這片土地和地上的一切、城邑和居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，我要派毒蛇去咬你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法術無法制伏牠們。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我有無限憂愁，傷心欲絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊！遠處傳來我同胞的哀鳴：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「難道耶和華不在錫安了嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道她的王不在她那裡了嗎？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「他們為什麼供奉雕刻的神像和外族無用的偶像，惹我發怒？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「麥收已完，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏季已過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我們還未得救。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為同胞的創傷而傷心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我痛苦萬分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驚慌失措。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道基列沒有藥物嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道那裡沒有醫生嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我同胞的創傷至今未癒？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}